SmoothLLM character perturbations and refusal-phrase judge
Source: https://github.com/arobey1/smooth-llm
Reference commit: 1855c8791d4ffbcd902abcdd1b5ef69fda1a96e0

The RandomSwapPerturbation, RandomPatchPerturbation, and RandomInsertPerturbation
implementations are adapted from the SmoothLLM perturbation design and modified to
use caller-provided random number generators and explicit edge-case handling. The
PrefixJudge default refusal phrases and matching semantics are adapted from SmoothLLM's
Defense.is_jailbroken implementation.

