JailbreakBench Llama-3 refusal Judge prompt and matching semantics
Source: https://github.com/JailbreakBench/jailbreakbench
Reference commit: 23dbdf6b19650521604456229bc1d9c4156c85c1

The versioned Llama-3-8B refusal Judge configuration incorporates the prompt and
positive-answer substring matching semantics from JailbreakBench's
Llama3RefusalJudge implementation. The local runner adds checkpointing, source
hashes, token accounting, and output-format auditing.

